  "module_docs": [
    "Port of `net.minestom.server.network.packet.server.play.SetSlotPacket`.",
    "",
    "# Shared wire helpers",
    "",
    "Java declares its wire primitives once on `NetworkBuffer`; the port keeps",
    "them in `crate::network::types` (`VECTOR3D`, `BLOCK_POSITION`,",
    "`Type::list`, `Type::map_value`, `enum_type`, \u2026). This file only hosts the",
    "three helpers that are specific to a packet payload rather than to a",
    "primitive, and that this partition shares:",
    "",
    "- [`write_item_stack`] / [`read_item_stack`] \u2014 `ItemStack.NETWORK_TYPE`,",
    "  the ported `ItemStack::network_type()`.",
    "- [`write_component_optional`] / [`read_component_optional`] \u2014",
    "  `COMPONENT.optional()`, over [`Component`](crate::text::Component).",
    "",
    "# Deferrals",
    "",
    "**None** for the item stack: [`write_item_stack`] and",
    "[`read_item_stack`] are the ported `ItemStack::network_type()`, so a",
    "resolved component patch (`DataComponent.PATCH_NETWORK_TYPE`: an added",
    "count, a removed count, then each entry) goes out and comes back.",
    "`probes/expected/itemstackwireprobe.json` pins that order."
  ],
